{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_434", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPer a new NCAA rule this season, a player can appear in as many as four games and still qualify for a redshirt season.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{આ નવા NCAA નિયમ અનુસાર, એક ખેલાડી ચાર રમતમાં મોટી સંખ્યામાં હાજરી આપી શકે છે અને છતાં પણ લાગણી કાળ માટે સજ્જ રહે છે.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 54, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 94}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{આ નવા NCAA નિયમ અનુસાર, એક ખેલાડી ચાર રમતમાં મોટી સંખ્યામાં હાજરી આપી શકે છે અને છતાં પણ લાગણી કાળ માટે સજ્જ રહે છે.}}", "ground_truth": "આ સિઝનમાં નવા એનસીએએ નિયમ પ્રમાણે, એક ખેલાડી ચાર જેટલા રમતોમાં રમી શકે છે અને હજી પણ રેડશેર્ટ સીઝન માટે પાત્ર બને છે.", "score": 0.509493670886076, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.21e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-fi-en_1", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nPeople living and registered with a GP in England will also be able to enrol for potential participation at their local participating sexual health clinic.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Englannissa asuvat ja lääkärin luona rekisteröityneet ihmiset voivat myös ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen paikallisessa osallistuvassa seksuaaliterveysklinikkassa.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 53, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 102}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Englannissa asuvat ja lääkärin luona rekisteröityneet ihmiset voivat myös ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen paikallisessa osallistuvassa seksuaaliterveysklinikkassa.}}", "ground_truth": "Englannissa asuvat ja yleislääkärin hoitoon ilmoittautuneet ihmiset voivat myös hakea kokeiluun paikallisella seksuaaliterveysklinikallaan.", "score": 0.4047619047619047, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.735e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-cs-en_446", "question": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nHMX-1 crews frequently perform training flights around the Washington area and at the South Lawn to practice depositing the President of the United States at the White House with inches of precision.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Posádky HMX-1 často provádějí výcvikové lety v oblasti Washingtonu a na jižním trávníku, aby cvičily dopravu prezidenta Spojených států do Bílého domu s přesností na několik centimetrů.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 65, "output_tokens": 64, "total_tokens": 129}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Posádky HMX-1 často provádějí výcvikové lety v oblasti Washingtonu a na jižním trávníku, aby cvičily dopravu prezidenta Spojených států do Bílého domu s přesností na několik centimetrů.}}", "ground_truth": "Posádky helikoptéry HMX-1 často trénují přistání v oblasti Washingtonu a na South Lawn a nacvičují případné přílety s prezidentem Spojených států do Bílého Domu s maximální přesností.", "score": 0.5613839285714285, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 4.815e-05}}
