{"global_index": "WMT19-fi-en_23", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nFleet-footed tortoise escaped again from a Japanese zoo\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Vikkelä kilpikonna pakeni jälleen japanilaisesta eläintarhasta}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 39, "output_tokens": 22, "total_tokens": 61}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Vikkelä kilpikonna pakeni jälleen japanilaisesta eläintarhasta}}", "ground_truth": "Vikkelä konna karkasi toistamiseen japanilaisesta eläintarhasta", "score": 0.3888888888888889, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 1.905e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-cs-en_38", "question": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nWhen the active component was purified from the liquid, it turned out to be a byproduct of tryptophan metabolism known as indole-3-lactic acid.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Když byla aktivní složka purifikována z kapaliny, ukázalo se, že je vedlejším produktem metabolismu tryptofanu, známým jako indol-3-mléčná kyselina.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 63, "output_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 119}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Když byla aktivní složka purifikována z kapaliny, ukázalo se, že je vedlejším produktem metabolismu tryptofanu, známým jako indol-3-mléčná kyselina.}}", "ground_truth": "Po odstranění aktivní složky z tekutiny se ukázalo, že jde o vedlejší produkt tryptofanového metabolismu známého jako kyselina indolyl-3-octová.", "score": 0.3333333333333333, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 4.3049999999999996e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_171", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe construction of the four wind turbines should cover the energy requirements of around 11,400 households – that equates to around a fifth of the energy requirements of all Viersen households.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen sollte den Energiebedarf von etwa 11.400 Haushalten decken – das entspricht etwa einem Fünftel des Energiebedarfs aller Haushalte in Viersen.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 64, "output_tokens": 45, "total_tokens": 109}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen sollte den Energiebedarf von etwa 11.400 Haushalten decken – das entspricht etwa einem Fünftel des Energiebedarfs aller Haushalte in Viersen.}}", "ground_truth": "Mit Errichtung der vier Windenergieanlagen soll der Strombedarf von rund 11 400 Haushalten gedeckt werden können - das entspricht rund einem Fünftel des Strombedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.", "score": 0.4694280078895464, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.66e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_266", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe trade-off from no two-a-days is more one-a-days, the Bruins pushing up the start of camp nearly a week from last season and holding practices during summer school for the first time during Mora's six seasons in Westwood.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Der Kompromiss, keine zwei Trainingseinheiten pro Tag zu haben, ist mehr Trainingseinheiten mit einer pro Tag, während die Bruins den Beginn des Camps fast eine Woche früher als letzte Saison vorverlegt haben und zum ersten Mal während Moras sechs Saisons in Westwood während der Sommerferien Übungen abhalten.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 74, "output_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 143}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Der Kompromiss, keine zwei Trainingseinheiten pro Tag zu haben, ist mehr Trainingseinheiten mit einer pro Tag, während die Bruins den Beginn des Camps fast eine Woche früher als letzte Saison vorverlegt haben und zum ersten Mal während Moras sechs Saisons in Westwood während der Sommerferien Übungen abhalten.}}", "ground_truth": "Der Kompromiss weg von den zwei Tagen ist mehr als ein Tag, an dem die Bruins den Beginn des Camps fast eine Woche nach der letzten Saison verschoben und während der Sommerschule zum ersten Mal während Moras sechs Spielzeiten in Westwood praktische Übungen durchführten.", "score": 0.5936477788329642, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 5.2499999999999995e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_649", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nConway blasted the network as a \"disgrace\" for comparing the accusations made against Kavanaugh to those directed at Bill Cosby, who was sentenced to three to ten years in Pennsylvania state prison last week.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{કોનવેને કેવાને વિરુદ્ધ ચાર્જ કરવાના દાવાઓને બિનલાંબા કરવામાં બિੱਲ કોઝ્બીની સામે દોષ ભરવાના સમાન ગણાવતા નેટવર્કને \"અવવાઅક\" તરીકે ફટકારી નાખ્યું છે, જેમણે ગયા અઠવાડીયે પેન્સીલવેનિયા રાજ્યની જેલમાં ત્રણથી દશ વર્ષની સજા ભોગવી.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 70, "output_tokens": 99, "total_tokens": 169}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{કોનવેને કેવાને વિરુદ્ધ ચાર્જ કરવાના દાવાઓને બિનલાંબા કરવામાં બિੱਲ કોઝ્બીની સામે દોષ ભરવાના સમાન ગણાવતા નેટવર્કને \"અવવાઅક\" તરીકે ફટકારી નાખ્યું છે, જેમણે ગયા અઠવાડીયે પેન્સીલવેનિયા રાજ્યની જેલમાં ત્રણથી દશ વર્ષની સજા ભોગવી.}}", "ground_truth": "કોનવેએ કેવેનોઉની વિરુદ્ધ કરવામાં આવેલા આરોપોની સરખામણી કરવા માટે નેટવર્કને \"કલંક\" તરીકે અપખોડ્યું, જે બિલ કોસ્બી પર નિર્દેશિત હતો, જેને ગયા સપ્તાહે પેન્સિલવેનિયા સ્ટેટ જેલમાં ત્રણથી દસ વર્ષની સજા ફટકારવામાં આવી હતી.", "score": 0.5331886065684551, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 6.989999999999999e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_682", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nGolf: 'Mollywood' duo on course to smash box office records\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{ગોલ્ફ: 'મોલીવૂડ' દ્વિધા બોક્સ ઓફિસના રેકોર્ડ તોડી નાખવાના માર્ગ પર}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 42, "output_tokens": 35, "total_tokens": 77}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{ગોલ્ફ: 'મોલીવૂડ' દ્વિધા બોક્સ ઓફિસના રેકોર્ડ તોડી નાખવાના માર્ગ પર}", "ground_truth": "ગોલ્ફ: બોક્સ ઑફિસના રેકોર્ડ્સને તોડવા માટે 'મોલીવુડ' જુગલબંધી સજ્જ", "score": 0.6351084812623273, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.73e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-fi-en_67", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nBefore the accident, 23-year-old Suur-Hamari was losing interest in snowboarding.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Ennen onnettomuutta 23-vuotias Suur-Hamari menetti kiinnostustaan lumilautailuun.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 47, "output_tokens": 30, "total_tokens": 77}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Ennen onnettomuutta 23-vuotias Suur-Hamari menetti kiinnostustaan lumilautailuun.}}", "ground_truth": "Ennen onnettomuutta 23-vuotiaan Suur-Hamarin suurin lautailuinto oli jo hiipumassa.", "score": 0.35, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.505e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_765", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis would have allowed it to better blend into its surroundings and evade its enemies, experts say, suggesting it was preyed on by larger dinosaurs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Dies hätte es ihm ermöglicht, sich besser in seine Umgebung einzufügen und seinen Feinden zu entkommen, sagen Experten, und deuten darauf hin, dass es von größeren Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 56, "output_tokens": 46, "total_tokens": 102}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Dies hätte es ihm ermöglicht, sich besser in seine Umgebung einzufügen und seinen Feinden zu entkommen, sagen Experten, und deuten darauf hin, dass es von größeren Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.}}", "ground_truth": "Dies hätte es erlaubt, sich besser in seine Umgebung zu mischen und seinen Feinden auszuweichen, sagen Experten, was darauf hindeutet, dass es von größeren Dinosauriern bedroht wurde.", "score": 0.7040625, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.6e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_369", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThey used the collateral to buy the Collingwood property where Colin opened the family's first jeans store.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Sie verwendeten die Sicherheiten, um das Collingwood-Grundstück zu kaufen, wo Colin den ersten Jeansladen der Familie eröffnete.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 47, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 80}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Sie verwendeten die Sicherheiten, um das Collingwood-Grundstück zu kaufen, wo Colin den ersten Jeansladen der Familie eröffnete.}}", "ground_truth": "Sie nutzten die Sicherheit, um die Collingwood-Liegenschaft zu kaufen, in der Colin den ersten Jeansladen der Familie eröffnete.", "score": 0.6507276507276507, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.685e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_516", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nKendrick Lamar appears to have been the victim of a sizeable leak of unreleased songs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{કેન્ડ્રિક લેમારએ જીતી ગયા છે કે તેઓ અજ્ઞાત ગીતોના મોટા લીકના શિકારી બની ગયા છે.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 46, "output_tokens": 34, "total_tokens": 80}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{કેન્ડ્રિક લેમારએ જીતી ગયા છે કે તેઓ અજ્ઞાત ગીતોના મોટા લીકના શિકારી બની ગયા છે.}}", "ground_truth": "કેંડરીક લેમર રીલિઝ ન થયેલા ગીતોના નોંધપાત્ર લીકના ભોગ બનેલા હોવાનું જણાય છે.", "score": 0.2776765836875127, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.73e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-zh-en_896", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nWiens’ research also revealed that local extinction vary from region to region. Compared to regions with temperate climate, the probability of local extinction of species in tropical regions is doubled.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{威恩斯的研究还揭示了地方灭绝因地区而异。与温带气候地区相比，热带地区物种的地方灭绝概率翻了一番。}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 63, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 106}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{威恩斯的研究还揭示了地方灭绝因地区而异。与温带气候地区相比，热带地区物种的地方灭绝概率翻了一番。}}", "ground_truth": "韦恩斯的研究还显示，本地灭绝因地区而不同，与温带地区相比，热带地区物种本地灭绝的几率会高1倍。", "score": 0.7002253944402705, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.525e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_805", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAcross the room, actors Darrius Bradshaw and Nick Rascona, who play Roger Malcom and Barnett Hester, rehearsed their lines.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{Im anderen Teil des Raumes probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 58, "output_tokens": 39, "total_tokens": 97}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{Im anderen Teil des Raumes probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.}", "ground_truth": "Auf der anderen Seite des Raumes probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Zeilen.", "score": 0.8386005382545175, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.21e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_239", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nDigital Life and Cheap Connectivity - The connectivity in Jio Phones will be very cheap for the users.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{ડિજિટલ જીવન અને સસ્તી કનેક્ટિવિટી - જિયો ફોનમાં કનેક્ટિવિટી યુઝર્સ માટે ખૂબ જ સસ્તી હશે.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 47, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 85}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{ડિજિટલ જીવન અને સસ્તી કનેક્ટિવિટી - જિયો ફોનમાં કનેક્ટિવિટી યુઝર્સ માટે ખૂબ જ સસ્તી હશે.}}", "ground_truth": "ડિજિટલ લાઈફ અને સસ્તી કનેક્ટિવિટી- જિયો ફોનમાં યૂજર્સને કનેકટિવિટી ખૂબ સસ્તે મળશે.", "score": 0.7270967741935483, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.985e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-cs-en_460", "question": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe Cretaceous was a time when giant theropods, meat-eating dinosaurs that stood on two legs, roamed the Earth.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Křída byla obdobím, kdy po Zemi putovali obří teropodi, masožraví dinosauři, kteří stáli na dvou nohách.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 57, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 97}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Křída byla obdobím, kdy po Zemi putovali obří teropodi, masožraví dinosauři, kteří stáli na dvou nohách.}}", "ground_truth": "V období křídy se po Zemi procházeli obrovští teropodi, masožraví dinosauři, kteří se pohybovali na dvou nohách.", "score": 0.5151515151515152, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.255e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_708", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIn addition, they will learn why stars have different colours, or why one star shines more brightly than another, although it is significantly further away.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Zusätzlich werden sie lernen, warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben haben oder warum ein Stern heller leuchtet als ein anderer, obwohl er deutlich weiter entfernt ist.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 56, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 89}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Zusätzlich werden sie lernen, warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben haben oder warum ein Stern heller leuchtet als ein anderer, obwohl er deutlich weiter entfernt ist.}}", "ground_truth": "Zudem lernten sie, warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben hätten oder warum ein Stern stärker leuchte als ein anderer, obwohl er wesentlich weiter entfernt liege.", "score": 0.6530612244897959, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.82e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-de-en_634", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAffected eggs should be destroyed or returned.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Betroffene Eier sollten vernichtet oder zurückgegeben werden.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 35, "output_tokens": 15, "total_tokens": 50}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Betroffene Eier sollten vernichtet oder zurückgegeben werden.}}", "ground_truth": "Betroffene Eier sollten vernichtet oder zurückgegeben werden.", "score": 0.9897959183673469, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 1.425e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-lt-en_643", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIt is unofficially stated that only 1% of certificates that certify packaging waste management were issued of the intended recycling tasks”, said Mr. Gentvilas in the press release.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Neoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1% sertifikatų, patvirtinančių pakuočių atliekų tvarkymo užduotis, buvo išduota numatytoms perdirbimo užduotims,” sakė ponas Gentvilas spaudos pranešime.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 64, "output_tokens": 70, "total_tokens": 134}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Neoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1% sertifikatų, patvirtinančių pakuočių atliekų tvarkymo užduotis, buvo išduota numatytoms perdirbimo užduotims,” sakė ponas Gentvilas spaudos pranešime.}}", "ground_truth": "Neoficialiai teigiama, kad pažymų, patvirtinančių pakuočių atliekų sutvarkymą, išduota vos 1% nuo numatytų perdirbimo užduočių\", - pranešime spaudai teigia p. Gentvilas.", "score": 0.4279379157427937, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 5.1599999999999994e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-gu-en_834", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAfter the incident, when my friend called me and talked as she cried, I felt as if someone had stabbed me in the heart.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{આ ઘટના બાદ, જ્યારે મારી સાથીએ મને ફોન કર્યો અને રડે જતાં વાત કરી, ત્યારે હું જાતે ઘરે ન કરવા જેવી લાગણી અનુભવી જેવું જણાય ગયું, જેમ કશો મને દિલમાં વાગ્યું હોય.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 54, "output_tokens": 53, "total_tokens": 107}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{આ ઘટના બાદ, જ્યારે મારી સાથીએ મને ફોન કર્યો અને રડે જતાં વાત કરી, ત્યારે હું જાતે ઘરે ન કરવા જેવી લાગણી અનુભવી જેવું જણાય ગયું, જેમ કશો મને દિલમાં વાગ્યું હોય.}}", "ground_truth": "એ ઘટના પછી સખીએ લગભગ રડતાં મારી સાથે બીજીવાર વાત કરી ત્યારે મને એવું લાગ્યું હતું કે કોઈએ જાણે મારાં હૈયામાં ખીલો ઠોકી દીધો છે.", "score": 0.45371089612315524, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.99e-05}}
