{"global_index": "WMT19-zh-en_968", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nBig screen luxury TVs have always been the hallmark of technological competence of manufacturers. The multiple award winning LG 77-inch curved OLED 4K Smart TV is a classic example of this type of products.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{大屏幕奢华电视一直是制造商技术实力的标志。屡获殊荣的LG 77英寸曲面OLED 4K智能电视就是此类产品的经典范例。}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 67, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 116}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{大屏幕奢华电视一直是制造商技术实力的标志。屡获殊荣的LG 77英寸曲面OLED 4K智能电视就是此类产品的经典范例。}}", "ground_truth": "大尺寸奢华电视一直是各大厂商技术实力的代表，此次拿奖拿到手软的LG带来的77英寸曲面4K OLED电视就是此类产品的典型。", "score": 0.6841866629464285, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 3.945e-05}}
