{"global_index": "WMT19-zh-en_232", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe methods for cleaning up large space debris include using an enormous net to clean up and collect the debris, as well as using magnetic material to suck them out of the orbit. Chinese scientists have conducted a laser simulation study and arrived at the following conclusion. This will be an effective method for cleaning up the Earth’s orbit.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{清理大型太空垃圾的方法包括使用巨大的网来清理和收集垃圾，以及使用磁性材料将它们从轨道中吸出。中国科学家进行了激光模拟研究，并得出了以下结论。这个方法将是清理地球轨道的有效手段。}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 91, "output_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 159}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{清理大型太空垃圾的方法包括使用巨大的网来清理和收集垃圾，以及使用磁性材料将它们从轨道中吸出。中国科学家进行了激光模拟研究，并得出了以下结论。这个方法将是清理地球轨道的有效手段。}}", "ground_truth": "清除大尺度空间碎片的方式包括用来清扫和收集废物的巨型网，以及可以被用来将它们吸出轨道的磁体。中国科学家进行了激光器仿真研究，得出以下结论，即这将是清理地球轨道的有效方式。", "score": 0.7013036809815951, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 5.4449999999999995e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-lt-en_56", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nThis is due to the fact that bicycle’s tracks are not segmented as human tracks, making it more difficult to isolate different locations for comparison - this is not natural for dogs, so more time is needed.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Tai yra dėl to, kad dviračių takeliai nėra segmentuoti kaip žmogaus takeliai, todėl sunkiau izoliuoti skirtingas vietas palyginimui - tai nėra natūralu šunims, todėl reikia daugiau laiko.}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 69, "output_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 128}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{Tai yra dėl to, kad dviračių takeliai nėra segmentuoti kaip žmogaus takeliai, todėl sunkiau izoliuoti skirtingas vietas palyginimui - tai nėra natūralu šunims, todėl reikia daugiau laiko.}}", "ground_truth": "Taip yra dėl to, kad dviračio vėžios nėra segmentuotos kaip einančio žmogaus pėdsakai, todėl sunkiau izoliuoti skirtingas vietas palyginimui - tai nėra natūralu šunims, todėl reikia daugiau laiko.", "score": 0.7748915486332514, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 4.575e-05}}
{"global_index": "WMT19-zh-en_674", "question": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nSince the earth’s inner core is thousands of kilometers deep, it is very difficult to explore the characteristics of its movement and change.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{由于地球的内核深达数千公里，探索其运动和变化的特征非常困难。}}", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 53, "output_tokens": 27, "total_tokens": 80}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{{由于地球的内核深达数千公里，探索其运动和变化的特征非常困难。}}", "ground_truth": "由于地球内核远在数千公里深的地下，了解它的运动变化特征十分困难", "score": 0.709655172413793, "metric": "meteor_score", "inference_cost": 2.4149999999999997e-05}}
