{"global_index": "OpenTDB_Science & Nature_2281", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Celiac Disease is a disease that effects the heart, causing those effected to be unable to eat meat.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "Celiac Disease is actually an autoimmune disorder that primarily affects the digestive system, specifically the small intestine, when gluten is consumed. It does not affect the heart nor does it cause individuals to be unable to eat meat, as meat does not contain gluten. Therefore, the correct answer is \\boxed{A}.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 94, "output_tokens": 61, "total_tokens": 155}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "Celiac Disease is actually an autoimmune disorder that primarily affects the digestive system, specifically the small intestine, when gluten is consumed. It does not affect the heart nor does it cause individuals to be unable to eat meat, as meat does not contain gluten. Therefore, the correct answer is \\boxed{A}.", "ground_truth": "0", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 5.069999999999999e-05}}
{"global_index": "OpenTDB_Science & Nature_3202", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A defibrillator is used to start up a heartbeat once a heart has stopped beating.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{A}. A defibrillator is used to restore a normal heartbeat in cases of certain serious heart conditions like arrhythmias, rather than starting up a heartbeat after it has completely stopped. If the heart has stopped beating completely, cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR) is typically needed alongside defibrillation.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 91, "output_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 162}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{A}. A defibrillator is used to restore a normal heartbeat in cases of certain serious heart conditions like arrhythmias, rather than starting up a heartbeat after it has completely stopped. If the heart has stopped beating completely, cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR) is typically needed alongside defibrillation.", "ground_truth": "0", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 5.625e-05}}
