{"global_index": "MMLUPro_health_4914", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: How are new polyomaviruses detailed\n\nOptions: \nA. Shot gun sequencing\nB. Cultivation in human neural cells\nC. Deep pyro sequencing (NGS)\nD. Monoclonal antibody techniques\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The most likely correct answer is \\boxed{C}. Deep pyro sequencing (Next-Generation Sequencing, NGS) is widely used in virology for identifying and detailing new viruses, including polyomaviruses, due to its ability to sequence large amounts of DNA quickly and accurately. Other techniques listed, such as shotgun sequencing, are less specific for new virus discovery compared to NGS.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 107, "output_tokens": 78, "total_tokens": 185}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The most likely correct answer is \\boxed{C}. Deep pyro sequencing (Next-Generation Sequencing, NGS) is widely used in virology for identifying and detailing new viruses, including polyomaviruses, due to its ability to sequence large amounts of DNA quickly and accurately. Other techniques listed, such as shotgun sequencing, are less specific for new virus discovery compared to NGS.", "ground_truth": "0", "score": 0.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 6.285e-05}}
{"global_index": "MMLUPro_health_5151", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: High levels of self-care behaviors have been associated with high levels of\n\nOptions: \nA. Extraversion\nB. Primary control\nC. Narcissism\nD. Openness to experience\nE. Conscientiousness\nF. Neuroticism\nG. Secondary control\nH. Agreeableness\nI. Self-efficacy\nJ. Emotional stability\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The most likely correct answer is \\boxed{I}. High levels of self-care behaviors are typically associated with high levels of self-efficacy, as individuals who believe they can effectively manage their health and well-being are more likely to engage in self-care practices. Self-efficacy reflects confidence in one's abilities, which aligns well with proactive self-care.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 139, "output_tokens": 70, "total_tokens": 209}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The most likely correct answer is \\boxed{I}. High levels of self-care behaviors are typically associated with high levels of self-efficacy, as individuals who believe they can effectively manage their health and well-being are more likely to engage in self-care practices. Self-efficacy reflects confidence in one's abilities, which aligns well with proactive self-care.", "ground_truth": "7", "score": 0.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 6.285e-05}}
